---
source: tests/help.rs
expression: help(&path)
---
Manage a sandbox declared in an sbxenv.yaml file

Usage: sbt env [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  create  Create a sandbox environment from sbxenv.yaml
  run     Create (if needed) and attach to a sandbox environment
  exec    Execute a command inside a sandbox environment
  rm      Remove a sandbox environment and its scoped resources
  plan    Show what applying an environment would change, without changing anything
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -D, --debug
          Print each smolvm command line

  -h, --help
          Print help
